{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787357219639776752,"compiled_state":{"alias":"amenable-befuddling-phoenix","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"c5b69011f0e4fc1c87ba79f09459635a344998f0996b0b01d6d4d1038726c98c","event_uuid":"5999f102-e2c7-4d4e-b82b-08a9ca762132","position":{"commit_sha":"f70f7d10e34110ef4509d12efcdfe587913dc9ee","position":"1787354692002889001-5999f102-e2c7-4d4e-b82b-08a9ca762132"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"0b44bf260f03f2bb81f57c168c34cb11a860101793cf79134d6419196a419813","event_uuid":"d3bedf74-3455-434a-b472-8cb57bd54dc0","position":{"commit_sha":"26f42729fc02243fe0de072252a6012b7c6213f2","position":"1787354701587024001-d3bedf74-3455-434a-b472-8cb57bd54dc0"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787354692002889001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe code-review `tests` overlay (blocking at 0.54) is selected only when a changed file matches `**/test_*.py`, `**/*_test.py`, `**/tests/**` (`src/rebar/llm/code_review/registry.py:295-311`, `glob_triggered_overlays`; routing `src/rebar/llm/code_review/criteria_routing.json` key `tests`). A change that adds product logic and touches no test file never runs the overlay unless the base reviewer recommends it, and the overlay's guard (vii) (`src/rebar/llm/reviewers/code-review-tests.md:73-75`) keeps a bare coverage-gap finding advisory. Five src-only changes merged on `LLM-Review +1` with zero test files (Gerrit 388, 1547, 1920, 1737, 1703); change 388 (`d9e0f0e733`, new `git_adapter.py`) later produced three bugs. Approved in the fortnight defect review (operator decision, 2026-08-21); the diff-coverage alternative was rejected because the project tests behaviour and contracts, not coverage percentage.\n\n## Approach\nAdd a content trigger in `registry.content_triggered_overlays` (`src/rebar/llm/code_review/registry.py:413`): select `tests` when the diff adds a function/method definition or a new conditional branch under `src/**` and changes no file under `tests/**`. Narrow guard (vii) in `code-review-tests.md` so that a gap on *newly introduced* behaviour with a named violating input is eligible to block; a gap on pre-existing code stays advisory. Docs, config, and pure renames add no definitions and never trigger. Keep the Four-Criterion test unchanged.\n\n## Scope\n`src/rebar/llm/code_review/registry.py`, `src/rebar/llm/reviewers/code-review-tests.md`, `src/rebar/llm/code_review/criteria_routing.json` (trigger provenance only), `tests/unit/llm/code_review/test_content_triggers.py` (new), `tests/unit/test_prompt_index.py` (prompt-index drift gate).\n\n## Testing\nHappy path: a diff adding `def` under `src/` with no `tests/` change selects `tests`. Edge: a docs-only diff, a config diff, and a rename-only diff (`git diff -M`) do not select it; a diff adding a `def` plus a test file selects it by glob as today. Pinning: `tests/unit/llm/code_review/test_registry*.py`, the overlay routing parity test, and `scripts/check_criteria_vocabulary.py` pass unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The five cited src-only diff shapes select the `tests` overlay when replayed through `glob_triggered_overlays`+`content_triggered_overlays`; checked by a parametrised test over synthetic diffs with the same file/def shape.\n- [ ] Docs-only, config-only and rename-only diffs do not select it; checked by the same test.\n- [ ] Guard (vii) text distinguishes newly-introduced from pre-existing behaviour and the prompt-index drift gate passes; checked by `pytest tests/unit/test_prompt_index.py`.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/code_review/registry.py","reason":"approved remediation edit"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/reviewers/code-review-tests.md","reason":"approved remediation edit"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/code_review/criteria_routing.json","reason":"approved remediation edit"},{"path":"tests/unit/llm/code_review/test_content_triggers.py","reason":"approved remediation edit"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_prompt_index.py","reason":"approved remediation edit"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["gates","fortnight-review"],"ticket_id":"2e0f-e4dc-ee9d-4855","ticket_type":"story","title":"Content-trigger the code-review tests overlay on new src behaviour with no test change","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["5999f102-e2c7-4d4e-b82b-08a9ca762132","d3bedf74-3455-434a-b472-8cb57bd54dc0"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787357219639776752,"uuid":"9787c941-a68a-4667-aee7-0092f9cd5acf"}